    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Court of the Phoenician",
    "summary": "Your **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** units get this ability:\n\n**Sensational Performance**: Whenever the unit gets **selected to fight** having made a [Charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move) earlier in the turn, you can activate this ability for it. If you do, these apply to it for the rest of the phase:\n\n- it can pick no target that it was in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of as the turn began\n- it can pick no target that another unit has attacked this phase\n- its melee weapons get +1 S and +1 AP",
